title: Desert.Heat
---
Molly: Man, if the vicious giant creatures here don't get me, the heat here might do the job instead!
Molly: How does a single kingdom contain so many climates?
King's Ghost: It happens to be one of the perks of living in a realm governed by nature spirits.
King's Ghost: Each familiar's inherent qualities tend to heavily influence the world around them.
King's Ghost: The residents of Aethelgard used to have a saying:
King's Ghost: "If you're not enjoying the weather, just walk a few miles and you can get it to change."
Molly: Charming.
